# Cursor Rules

## Database and Package Management
- NEVER run supabase commands (supabase db reset, supabase start, etc.)
- NEVER run pnpm commands (pnpm install, pnpm dev, etc.)
- NEVER run npm commands
- NEVER run test scripts or build commands
- These commands can disrupt the user's development environment

## Migration Management
- ALWAYS consolidate all migrations into the initial migration file
- NEVER create separate migration files for related changes
- Design schema correctly from the start to avoid dropping and recreating constraints

## Documentation
- NEVER write summaries inside markdown files
- Keep documentation minimal and inline with code when necessary

## Code Analysis Only
- Focus on code analysis, reading files, and making targeted edits
- Use grep_search and codebase_search for investigation
- Read files to understand the codebase structure
- Make precise code changes when needed 